Version 2.21, December 21, 1993

11/18/93 struct __iobuf renamed _iobuf in <stdio.h>

11/16/93 toupper/tolower temps made static

The temporary variables used by toupper and tolower to avoid evaluating
the argument twice have been made static to avoid problems with the change
that makes declarations that are tentative definitions in C be true
definitions in C++.

11/15/93 Size of setjmp buffer

The setjmp buffer in setjmp.h has been changed to match the size of the
buffer used by SunOS 4.1.2.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 2.20, November 4, 1993

11/04/93 Exit function has C++ linkage

The exit function has been changed to have C++ linkage.  A version of
exit is now supplied with the C++ runtime to support exception handling.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 2.09, September 15, 1992

9/13/92  stdarg.h updated for sparc architecture.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 2.05, April 30, 1992

first official release.
